        </a>

        <a
          href="index.html#recursos"
          class="nk-nav-link"
        >
          Recursos
        </a>

        <a
          href="index.html#precios"
          class="nk-nav-link"
        >
          Precios
        </a>

      </nav>


      <a
        href="index.html#precios"
        class="nk-btn nk-btn-primary"
      >
        Ver Pro
      </a>

    </div>

  </header>


  <!-- =====================================================
       MAIN
       ===================================================== -->

  <main>

    <section class="nk-section">

      <div class="nk-container">

        <div
          style="
            max-width: 800px;
            margin-bottom: 34px;
          "
        >

          <div class="nk-eyebrow">
            Herramienta NegocioKit Pro
          </div>

          <h1 class="nk-title">
            Calculadora de Punto de Equilibrio
          </h1>

          <p class="nk-subtitle">
            Descubre cuántas ventas necesitas generar para
            cubrir tus costos antes de comenzar a obtener
            utilidad.
          </p>

        </div>


        <!-- =================================================
             CALCULATOR
             ================================================= -->

        <div
          class="nk-grid nk-grid-2"
          style="align-items: start;"
        >


          <!-- INPUTS -->

          <section class="nk-card">

            <div class="nk-card-body">

              <div
                style="
                  display: flex;
                  justify-content: space-between;
                  align-items: center;
                  gap: 12px;
                  margin-bottom: 20px;
                  flex-wrap: wrap;
                "
              >

                <h2 style="margin: 0;">
                  Datos de tu negocio
                </h2>

                <span class="nk-badge nk-badge-orange">
                  Pro
                </span>

              </div>


              <form
                id="breakEvenCalculator"
                class="nk-form"
                novalidate
              >


                <!-- FIXED COSTS -->

                <div class="nk-field">

                  <label
                    class="nk-label"
                    for="fixedCosts"
                  >
                    Costos fijos mensuales
                  </label>

                  <input
                    id="fixedCosts"
                    class="nk-input"
                    type="number"
                    min="0"
                    step="0.01"
                    inputmode="decimal"
                    placeholder="Ej. 5000"
                    required
                  >

                  <small
                    style="
                      color: var(--nk-text-muted);
                    "
                  >
                    Alquiler, salarios, servicios,
                    software y otros gastos fijos.
                  </small>

                </div>


                <!-- SALE PRICE -->

                <div class="nk-field">

                  <label
                    class="nk-label"
                    for="averageSale"
                  >
                    Venta promedio por orden
                  </label>

                  <input
                    id="averageSale"
                    class="nk-input"
                    type="number"
                    min="0"
                    step="0.01"
                    inputmode="decimal"
                    placeholder="Ej. 25"
                    required
                  >

                  <small
                    style="
                      color: var(--nk-text-muted);
                    "
                  >
                    Tu ingreso promedio por producto,
                    ticket u orden.
                  </small>

                </div>


                <!-- VARIABLE COST -->

                <div class="nk-field">

                  <label
                    class="nk-label"
                    for="variableCost"
                  >
                    Costo variable por orden
                  </label>

                  <input
                    id="variableCost"
                    class="nk-input"
                    type="number"
                    min="0"
                    step="0.01"
                    inputmode="decimal"
                    placeholder="Ej. 10"
                    required
                  >

                  <small
                    style="
                      color: var(--nk-text-muted);
                    "
                  >
                    Ingredientes, empaque o costos que
                    aumentan cada vez que vendes.
                  </small>

                </div>


                <!-- TARGET SALES -->

                <div class="nk-field">

                  <label
                    class="nk-label"
                    for="targetUnits"
                  >
                    Ventas mensuales estimadas
                    <span
                      style="
                        color: var(--nk-text-soft);
                        font-weight: 500;
                      "
                    >
                      (opcional)
                    </span>
                  </label>

                  <input
                    id="targetUnits"
                    class="nk-input"
                    type="number"
                    min="0"
                    step="1"
                    inputmode="numeric"
                    placeholder="Ej. 500"
                  >

                </div>


                <div
                  id="calculatorError"
                  role="alert"
                  style="
                    display: none;
                    padding: 12px 14px;
                    background: var(--nk-danger-light);
                    color: var(--nk-danger);
                    border-radius: var(--nk-radius-md);
                    font-size: 0.88rem;
                    font-weight: 650;
                  "
                >
                </div>


                <button
                  type="submit"
                  class="nk-btn nk-btn-primary"
                >
                  Calcular punto de equilibrio
                </button>

              </form>

            </div>

          </section>


          <!-- =================================================
               RESULTS
               ================================================= -->

          <section
            class="nk-card"
            aria-live="polite"
          >

            <div class="nk-card-body">

              <div class="nk-eyebrow">
                Resultado
              </div>

              <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">
                Tu punto de equilibrio
              </h2>


              <div
                style="
                  margin: 24px 0;
                  padding: 24px;
                  background: var(--nk-orange-light);
                  border-radius: var(--nk-radius-lg);
                  text-align: center;
                "
              >

                <div
                  style="
                    color: var(--nk-text-muted);
                    font-size: 0.82rem;
                    font-weight: 700;
                  "
                >
                  ORDENES NECESARIAS
                </div>

                <div
                  id="breakEvenUnits"
                  style="
                    margin-top: 6px;
                    color: var(--nk-orange-dark);
                    font-size: 2.8rem;
                    font-weight: 900;
                    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
                  "
                >
                  0
                </div>

              </div>


              <div
                class="nk-grid nk-grid-2"
                style="gap: 12px;"
              >

                <div class="nk-stat-card">

                  <div class="nk-stat-label">
                    Ventas necesarias
                  </div>

                  <div
                    id="breakEvenRevenue"
                    class="nk-stat-value"
                  >
                    $0.00
                  </div>

                </div>


                <div class="nk-stat-card">

                  <div class="nk-stat-label">
                    Margen contribución
                  </div>

                  <div
                    id="contributionMargin"
                    class="nk-stat-value"
                  >
                    0%
                  </div>

                </div>


                <div class="nk-stat-card">

                  <div class="nk-stat-label">
                    Ganancia objetivo
                  </div>

                  <div
                    id="targetProfit"
                    class="nk-stat-value"
                  >
                    $0.00
                  </div>

                </div>


                <div class="nk-stat-card">

                  <div class="nk-stat-label">
                    Resultado estimado
                  </div>

                  <div
                    id="projectedProfit"
                    class="nk-stat-value"
                  >
                    $0.00
                  </div>

                </div>

              </div>


              <div
                style="
                  margin-top: 24px;
                  padding-top: 20px;
                  border-top: 1px solid var(--nk-border);
                "
              >

                <strong>
                  Fórmula
                </strong>

                <p
                  style="
                    color: var(--nk-text-muted);
                    font-size: 0.9rem;
                  "
                >
                  Punto de equilibrio =
                  Costos fijos ÷ (Venta promedio -
                  Costo variable por orden).
                </p>

              </div>

            </div>

          </section>

        </div>


        <!-- =================================================
             EDUCATIONAL CARDS
             ================================================= -->

        <section
          class="nk-card"
          style="margin-top: 24px;"
        >

          <div class="nk-card-body">

            <div class="nk-grid nk-grid-3">


              <article>

                <span class="nk-badge nk-badge-orange">
                  01
                </span>

                <h3>
                  Costos fijos
                </h3>

                <p class="nk-subtitle">
                  Son costos que normalmente permanecen
                  relativamente constantes aunque vendas
                  más o menos.
                </p>

              </article>


              <article>

                <span class="nk-badge nk-badge-green">
                  02
                </span>

                <h3>
                  Margen de contribución
                </h3>

                <p class="nk-subtitle">
                  Es la parte de cada venta que queda
                  disponible para cubrir tus costos fijos.
                </p>

              </article>


              <article>

                <span class="nk-badge nk-badge-gray">
                  03
                </span>

                <h3>
                  Más allá del equilibrio
                </h3>

                <p class="nk-subtitle">
                  Después de alcanzar el equilibrio,
                  cada venta adicional puede contribuir
                  a generar utilidad.
                </p>

              </article>

            </div>

          </div>

        </section>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =====================================================
         CTA
         ===================================================== -->

    <section class="nk-section">

      <div class="nk-container">

        <div
          class="nk-card"
          style="
            padding: 44px;
            background:
              linear-gradient(
                135deg,
                var(--nk-charcoal),
                #303b48
              );
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
          "
        >

          <div class="nk-eyebrow">
            NegocioKit Pro
          </div>

          <h2
            style="
              margin: 0;
              font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.7rem);
              letter-spacing: -0.03em;
            "
          >
            Convierte números en decisiones.
          </h2>

          <p
            style="
              max-width: 680px;
              margin: 16px auto 0;
              color: #d7dde3;
            "
          >
            Próximamente podrás guardar tus escenarios,
            comparar meses y construir una vista completa
            de la rentabilidad de tu negocio.
          </p>

          <div
            style="margin-top: 24px;"
          >

            <a
              href="tools.html"
              class="nk-btn nk-btn-primary"
            >
              Ver todas las herramientas
            </a>

          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>

  </main>


  <!-- =====================================================
       FOOTER
       ===================================================== -->

  <footer class="nk-footer">

    <div class="nk-container">

      <div class="nk-footer-grid">


        <div>

          <div class="nk-brand">

            <img
              src="assets/images/logo.png"
              alt=""
              width="42"
              height="42"
            >

            <div class="nk-brand-name">
              Negocio<span>Kit</span>
            </div>

          </div>

          <p>
            Recursos digitales para restaurantes,
            cafeterías y pequeños negocios.
          </p>

        </div>


        <div>

          <strong>
            Producto
          </strong>

          <p>
            <a href="tools.html">
              Herramientas
            </a>
          </p>

          <p>
            <a href="index.html#recursos">
              Recursos
            </a>
          </p>

        </div>


        <div>

          <strong>
            NegocioKit
          </strong>

          <p>
            <a href="index.html#precios">
              Precios
            </a>
          </p>

          <p>
            <a href="#">
              Contacto
            </a>
          </p>

        </div>


        <div>

          <strong>
